msgctxt "Item:5003:0:8"
msgid "Similar to its cousin the mudskipper, the sludgeskipper can also survive outside water for several bells. The sludgeskipper, however, is at home in highly polluted pools where other creatures would likely perish.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr ""

