#. column 0: pinch of alumina salts
#. column 8: A fine-grain form of the mineral alumina found in the stomach of a chimera. It is believed the creature grinds chunks of alumina ore with its powerful jaws and swallows the resulting powder to use as a catalyst for its fiery breath.
#. column 9: Alumina Salts
msgctxt "Item:5264:0:2"
msgid "pinches of alumina salts"
msgstr ""

#. ja: キマイラの体内に蓄積したアルミナの研粒
#. de: Ein grobkörniger Sand aus Korund, wie man ihn auch im Magen einer Chimära finden kann. Diese Bestie frisst Helden samt Rüstung, die durch ebenfalls verschlucktes und äußerst hartes Korund im Magen zerkleinert werden.
#. fr: Cette poussière d'émeri abrasif semble s'être accumulée dans le corps de la chimère.
#. column 0: pinch of alumina salts
#. column 2: pinches of alumina salts
#. column 9: Alumina Salts
msgctxt "Item:5264:0:8"
msgid "A fine-grain form of the mineral alumina found in the stomach of a chimera. It is believed the creature grinds chunks of alumina ore with its powerful jaws and swallows the resulting powder to use as a catalyst for its fiery breath."
msgstr ""

